                <pb facs="0610" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg530"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.42157Sa29/643: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Canada</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ottawa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-03T16:00:00-05:00">December 3, 1929—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>233. Legation’s 230, November 25, 8 p.m. Prime Minister informs me today that
                    neither Minister of Justice nor Doctor Skelton will return to Ottawa in time to
                    hold conference of Premiers before Christmas and that accordingly the conference
                    in question will not take place before January.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
